{"id":"erdbeben","lemma":"Erdbeben","pos":"noun","rank":3670,"glosses":["earthquake","shudder"],"ipa":"/ˈeːɐ̯tˌbeːbn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/27/De-Erdbeben.ogg/De-Erdbeben.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Erdbebens","plural":"Erdbeben"},"formAudio":{"Erdbebens":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Erdbebens.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Das war kein Erdbeben.","en":"That was not an earthquake.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},null]},{"text":"Ich fürchte mich vor Erdbeben.","en":"I'm afraid of earthquakes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760724","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to fear","l":"fürchten"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null]},{"text":"Gestern war ein Erdbeben.","en":"There was an earthquake yesterday.","words":[{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Erdbeben können jeden Augenblick geschehen.","en":"Earthquakes may occur at any moment.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to"},null,null,{"g":"to occur"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"any time now"]]},{"text":"Ich dachte, es wäre ein Erdbeben.","en":"I thought it was an earthquake.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}